    "Increase downward bias when sentiment history includes 0.67 or higher, indicating bullish sentiment, but model underperforms.",
    "Correct for lag: if true outcome is significantly higher than forecast 3-5 days later, adjust future forecasts to reflect recent upward momentum.",
    "When sentiment history includes 0.00 for 3+ consecutive days, reduce forecast volatility and apply conservative downward bias."
